// TestDare_ReducedInputsConvergedXGainNotCertifiedWrong: with rank-deficient
// B (n 6, m 7; reduced, not rotated inputs), cheap control (R about 3e-7)
// and an upper-triangular E with last pivot 2.6e-3, X refined to within
// 2e-15 of the 320-bit X had a Newton step of 1.2e-16, so it came without
// the Newton iterate gainMiss also measures K against; K, the ddGain of
// that X, was measured against itself and Dare returned it at Accuracy 0,
// 2.6e-4 off the 320-bit gain (band 1.5e-4), the gain of the next iterate
// 2.2e-4 from it (V4OJPR, rv49vGen 4917, NoScaling true, native). K stays
// within its band at Accuracy 0.
